WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
That is our third base in the future

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Not too big, just a few hundred people

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
There are more than fifty leaders alone inside

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Feng Tianxi is one of them

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,480
Is the base far from here?

6
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:13,480
It's not that close, it takes at least half a day to walk.

7
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,480
Does the base manage water and food?

8
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,480
Only those who work have food rations

9
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,480
Water is distributed regularly

10
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,480
But the time is never right

11
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,480
Only this Jinke would exchange it for a cup

12
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,480
Very expensive

13
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,480
Then if I go to your base to promote

14
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,480
Review food and water here

15
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,480
what do you think

16
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,480
That's absolutely great

17
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,480
The high temperature season is getting hotter year after year

18
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,480
The heat kills many people in Kosi every year

19
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,480
If everyone knew

20
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,480
Boss, there is water and food here.

21
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,480
I'm sure everyone is willing to come

22
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,480
I won’t be too busy by then

23
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:36,480
Boss, just ask, Sister Wang

24
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,480
You and I thought we'd be together

25
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:38,480
My store warehouse

26
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,480
Hundreds of empty bottles piled up

27
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,480
I'm just worried that I have no place to use it.

28
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,480
just what

29
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:43,480
Boss, just say it

30
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:44,480
I will do whatever I can do
